{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48835","headline":"荅友人新栽松 · 张碧","name":"荅友人新栽松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石门新长青龙髯，虬身宛转云光粘。\n闻君爱我幽崖前，十株五株寒霜天。\n越溪老僧头削雪，曾云手植当庭月。\n三十年来遮火云，凉风五月生空门。\n愿君栽於清涧泉，贞姿莫迓夭桃妍。\n□□易开还易落，贞姿郁郁长依然。\n山童嬾上孤峰巅，当窗划破屏风烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张碧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48835.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48835","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}